<title>USA: Health At Home expands in Alabama.</title>
<headline>Health At Home expands in Alabama.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Help At Home Inc said Monday it began operating five new offices in Alabama to serve customers in that state.</p>
<p>The move was made in cojunction with Help At Home's recent acquisition of Oxford HealthCare.</p>
<p>The company won 12 contracts to provide homemaker and other homecare services throughout Alabama.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
